29:40.110 --> 29:41.210
Zhou Wan.

29:42.340 --> 29:43.070
Jalan.

29:43.070 --> 29:44.160
Polis… polis dah sampai!

29:43.690 --> 29:46.280
♪ Perlahan-lahan diselamatkan ♪

29:44.190 --> 29:46.120
Abang, cepat jalan!

30:10.530 --> 30:12.390
Pusingkan muka awak ke arah sini.

30:23.660 --> 30:26.120
Saya tolong awak rawat
secara ringkas dulu.

30:29.570 --> 30:31.500
Lebih baik awak pergi ke hospital.

30:33.130 --> 30:34.860
Jangan kena air pada luka awak,

30:34.920 --> 30:36.650
